    },
    {
      "s": "One day on Venus is equal to 243 Earth days. So you better hit a discount liquor store before you go.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "728186_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "OR\r\nSpace relativity teaches us it really is 5 o’clock somewhere\r\nOR\r\nBut please pilot planetary landing vehicles responsibily \r\nOR\r\nSo lost weekends really are Lost in Space.\r\nOR\r\nWhich is why so many people promise to quit drinking tomorrow on Venus.",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Imagine you’re planning a girl’s trip with a single goal: Rosé ALL DAY. Considering the length of their days, which of these destinations would allow you to drink wine for the longest period of time?",
